From 23198601e1163787e541cc00d428f12f15af1cbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:25:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/78] Port the remaining main menu entries and View/Items
 commands

Drop (H013+$2B9A, H053+$00CA, H066+$1312), Modify (H013+$2D76..$31E0),
Knight Change Classes (H013+$43E8/$4508), Save Current Game
(H066+$3000) and Load Saved Game (H066+$291E); View Trade/Drop of
money (H065+$12D6/$1636) with the H067 money helpers and H045+$000C;
Items Trade, Sell and Id (H065+$1D94/$20EC/$2308); H014+$0018.
The 3D map loads after Load Saved Game stay unported (adventure only).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
